  - Synthesis using apparatus:
    - (Ä) ojHkqo% lq"kek dFka lEHkklrs\
- Additional sections expand the range:
  - Matching columns and term association (e.g., fo|kLFkkukfu 85):
    - ([k) ---------------------- vÄ~xkfuA ("kV~)
    - (x) ---------------------- ''kkL=kkf.kA (prqj~)
    - (?k) ---------------------- uk;d%A (,d)
    - (Ä) ---------------------- iqjk.kkfuA (v"Vkn''k)
  - Fill-in, derivation, and grammar prompts:
    - (d) txrks ;=k fuc¼a rf}Ks;a iqjk.ke~A
    - ([k) iqjk.kizHksn ,o bfrgkl%A
    - (x) v"Vkn''k ,o JqR;FkZLej.kkRLe`r;%A
    - (?k) l p f}/k ifjfØ;kiqjkdYikH;ke~A
    - (Ä) r=k o.kkZuka LFkku&dj.k&iz;RukfnfHk%
  - Morphology and vocabulary tasks:
    - (d) okÄ~e;L; mHkkS HksnkS fy[kr\
    - ([k) vikSjQ"ks;a fde~ vfLr\
    - (x) foo`ÙkfØ;krU=kk% osQ lfUr\
    - (?k) czkg~e.ka osQ"kka LrqfrfuUnkO;k[;kufofu;ksxku~ djksfr\
