- gfjrghjde~ — gfjra ghjde~; deZ/kj; gjk ghjkA

How to drill
- Read the pair, then immediately say the cue/meaning aloud (e.g., “ojHkqo% — Js"B Hkwfe dkA”).
- Write a one-line usage for two items, preserving the meaning hint.

Sample usage
