Focus:
- Produces apt captions (mfprka) for images (fp=ka), training precise descriptive language aligned to context.

Textual and reference integration
- ÍXosn% (la-iz-,u-,l-lksuVDds; oSfnd la''kks/u e.My; iwuk&egkjk"Vª&02) and related entries indicate the reference base anchoring language items in curated, edited sources.
- The fo|kLFkkukfu section labeled osnk% osnkÄ~xkfu ''kkL=kkf.k situates language learning within the broader disciplinary theme.

Attentive reading tasks that fold into language focus
- Early task set:
  - okÄ~e;L; mHkkS HksnkS fy[kr\
